###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}10\blueE{k}+8\blueE{k}+\goldE{1}+\goldE{2}
\\\\
&=(10+8)\blueE{k}+\goldE{1}+\goldE{2}
\\\\
&=18\blueE{k}+\goldE{3}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $18\blueE{k}+\goldE{3}$ since they aren't like terms.
